# Uvagf · 49 · Penfu-fnsr qvfx ohssre sbe n ybt fuvccre

## Uvag 1

Fgneg ba cncre: jevgr gur olgrf bs n erpbeq, jung n frtzrag'f anzr gryyf lbh, naq jung gur npx
svyr ubyqf. Gura yvfg gur fgngr n Ohssre xrrcf va zrzbel: gur svefg frd bs rirel frtzrag, gur bcra
svyr bs gur ynfg bar naq vgf fvmr, gur arkg frd, gur npxrq frd. Gur anzrf ner gur vaqrk: frtzrag
*v* ubyqf gur frdf sebz vgf bja anzr gb gur arkg frtzrag'f anzr zvahf 1, naq gur ynfg bar hc gb
`arkg - 1`. Jevgr QrpbqrErpbeq nf n cher shapgvba ba n `[]olgr`, fb gung ernqvat n frtzrag vf
`bf.ErnqSvyr` cyhf n ybbc.

## Uvag 2

N penfu bayl qnzntrf gur raq bs gur svyr gung jnf orvat jevggra, naq vs lbh flap n frtzrag orsber
lbh perngr gur arkg bar, gung vf nyjnlf gur ynfg frtzrag. Fb n oebxra erpbeq ng gur irel raq bs
gur ynfg frtzrag vf n gbea jevgr: phg vg. Rirelguvat ryfr (n oebxra erpbeq jvgu vagnpg qngn nsgre
vg, qnzntr va na byqre frtzrag, n jebat erpbeq pbhag, erpbeqf zvffvat nsgre gur npx) vf fbzrguvat
n penfu pnaabg qb: ercbeg vg naq punatr abguvat. Guerr zber gencf: jevgr gur npx qhenoyl orsber
lbh qryrgr n frtzrag; gnxr gur arkg frd nf `znk(npx, ynfg frd ba qvfx) + 1`, orpnhfr nsgre n
cbjre ybff gur npx pna or nurnq bs gur qngn; naq erghea `o[8:a:a]`, abg `o[8:a]`, be n pnyyre'f
`nccraq` birejevgrf gur arkg erpbeq.

## Uvag 3

Bcra, va gjb cunfrf. Cunfr 1 bayl ernqf naq qrpvqrf:

1. Inyvqngr gur bcgvbaf, `bf.ZxqveNyy` gur qverpgbel, ernq `npx` (ab svyr zrnaf 0; tneontr vf n
   `*PbeehcgReebe` sbe `npx`).
2. Yvfg gur `.frt` svyrf jvgu `bf.ErnqQve` (fbegrq ol anzr) naq cnefr gurve svefg frdf.
3. Sbe rnpu byqre frtzrag: vs vgf jubyr enatr vf npxrq, cyna gb qryrgr vg, haernq. Bgurejvfr ernq
   vg naq purpx gung vg ubyqf rknpgyl `arkg anzr - bja anzr` vagnpg erpbeqf naq ab rkgen olgrf.
4. Sbe gur ynfg frtzrag: qrpbqr hagvy `vb.RBS`. Ba `vb.ReeHarkcrpgrqRBS`, be ba `ReePurpxfhz` jurer
   bssfrg + a vf gur svyr fvmr, erzrzore gur bssfrg nf gur phg cbvag naq fgbc. Nal bgure reebe vf
   n `*PbeehcgReebe`. Vs nyy vgf erpbeqf ner npxrq, cyna gb qryrgr vg.
5. Gur svefg frtzrag lbh xrrc zhfg fgneg ng be orsber `npx + 1`.

Cunfr 2 nccyvrf gur cyna: qryrgr, gehapngr naq flap, bcra gur ynfg xrcg frtzrag jvgu
`B_JEBAYL|B_NCCRAQ`, naq frg `arkg` gb vgf svefg frd cyhf vgf erpbeq pbhag (be `npx + 1`).

Nccraq: ybpx, purpx pybfrq naq fvmr, rapbqr, ebgngr vs gurer vf ab bcra frtzrag be vs vg vf abg
rzcgl naq gur erpbeq qbrf abg svg (flap naq pybfr gur byq svyr, perngr gur arj bar jvgu `B_RKPY`,
flap gur qverpgbel), jevgr, flap vs nfxrq, erghea `arkg` naq vaperzrag vg.

ErnqSebz: fgneg ng `znk(frd, npxrq + 1)`, fxvc frtzragf gung raq orsber gung, ernq rnpu erznvavat
bar vagb n arj fyvpr (sa xrrcf gur cnlybnqf, fb arire erhfr n ernq ohssre), qrpbqr vg naq pnyy sa.

Npx: jevgr n grzcbenel svyr, flap, pybfr, eranzr, flap gur qverpgbel, frg `npxrq`, gura qryrgr gur
byqrfg frtzragf juvyr gurve jubyr enatr vf npxrq (pybfr gur bcra svyr svefg vs vg vf gur ynfg
bar).
